2 CONT Manuel Duque de Estrada y Tovar, Capitan de Milicias, Regidor perpetuo and Alcalde ordinario de Bayamo. Married at the Parroquial Mayor de Bayamo on December 16--, Maria Gutierrez Franco, daughter of Juan Francisco Franco and  Isa
2 CONC bel Palacin Gutierrez, naturales de Jamaica. Maria Gutierrez Franco bequeated a Capellania [Chaplaincy] worth 450 pesos.  Issue: Isabel, who died single, and Leonor Duque de Estrada y Franco who married Jacinto de Agramonte y Ponc
