2 CONT * Location info: [https://www.geni.com/projects/Paris-of-the-Ancien-R%25C3%25A9gime-Period/30720 Paris],  [https://www.geni.com/projects/Isle-de-France-province-France/24575 Isle de France, France] (birth), [https://www.geni.com/p
