2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/projects/Pioneers-of-Canada-Quebec/17839 Pionnière de la Nouvelle-France]. Arrive au Québec le 18 juin 1665 à l'âge de 26 à bord du [https://www.geni.com/projects/Passagers-du-St-Jean-Baptiste-1665/26041 Sa
2 CONC int Jean-Baptiste]. A été une [https://www.geni.com/projects/Filles-du-roi/13635 fille du Roy].
2 CONT
2 CONT '''More Notes'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Of Pilois: First marriage annulled by contract on October 5th, 1665, Duquet notary.  27 years old in the 1667 census, 46 year old in the 1681 census.  Assumed to be a "fille de roi," arriving in the country in 1669.  She lived in 
2 CONC Vercheres.  Contracted second marriage on October 14th, 1665, Aubert notary.
2 CONT
