2 CONT LAMARCHE, Catherine Marguerite de
2 CONT
2 CONT While the De Billy families in Quebec are probably descending from one of the noble De Billy families and the line from them to a king is documented in Père Anselme, the links to the parents of Jean-François is not proven.  The de
2 CONC monstration of René Jetté in his traité can be considered as meaningful as it says something like (p. 591) "...if the migrant Jean François de Billy is actually the son of  François de Billy, seigneur de Baricourt:  "... si l'immi
2 CONC grant français Jean François de Billy était bien fils de François de Billy, seigneur de Baricourt...". TG 585-592
2 CONT
