2 CONT Francisco I De La Garza-Falcon (son of Marcos Alonso Garza Falcon and Juana De Treviño Quintanilla) was born Abt. 1604 in Durango, and died Abt. 1660. He married Juana Gutierrez De Lara Garcia on Abt. 1639 in Monterrey, N.L..
2 CONT
2 CONT ======================
2 CONT
2 CONT name also given as -
2 CONT * Francisco De La Garza
2 CONT * Francisco DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO
2 CONT * Francisco De La Garza Falcon 
2 CONT * Francisco de la Garza de Tremiño
2 CONT ===============
2 CONT
2 CONT Captain Francisco de la Garza lived at the Hacienda de San Francisco (today Apodaca, Nuevo Leon) "from the time he entered this Kingdom until he died.*1 around the year 1660.(43) 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://ftrevino.com/11_Ancestors/b265.htm
