1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Capt. Alejo de TREVIÑO378,402 was born (date unknown). Marriage Investigations #58-20 and #62-24 definitely point to his parents being Joseph de Treviño and Leonor de Ayala; however, Marriage Investigation #10-8 in
2 CONC dicates that his father was Alonso de Treviño, brother of Blas de la Garza Falcon. Parents: Joseph de TREVIÑO and Leonor de AYALA (aka Leonor de Treviño).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria de ARRIOLA. Maria de ARRIOLA and Capt. Alejo de TREVIÑO were married. Children were: Francisco Alejo de TREVIÑO, Alejo de TREVIÑO.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b216.html#P1056
2 CONT
2 CONT =============================
2 CONT 7. CAPTAIN FRANCISCO-ALEJO9 DE TREVINO-AYALA (JOSEPH-DIEGO8 DE TREMINO-Y-QUINTANILLA, JOSE-DIEGO7 DE TREMINO, DIEGO6 TREMINO-DE-VELASCO, BERNARDINO5 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, FRANCISCO4, PEDRO3, JUAN2, PEDRO1) was born Abt. 1617 in Ce
2 CONC rralvo, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died Bef. 1684 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married MARIA DE ARRIOLA-MELENDEZ, daughter of JUAN RAMOS-DE-ARRIOLA and MARIA MENLENDEZ. She was born 1620, and died 06 Jun 1684 in Monterrey, Nu
2 CONC evo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCO-ALEJO DE TREVINO-AYALA and MARIA DE ARRIOLA-MELENDEZ are:
