1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L5GG-DND
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Cassé was born on 12 September 1669, in Sainte-Famille, Québec, Canada, New France, his father, Antoine Cassé, was 28 and his mother, Françoise De Pitié, was 34. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Bazin on 27 June 1691, in Saint-Joseph-de-la-Pointe-à-Lévy, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 11 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Françoise Cassé 1692–1764
2 CONT Antoine Cassée 1693–1766
2 CONT Marie Françoise Cassée Casse 1695–1764
2 CONT Louise Cassée 1696–1766
2 CONT Marie Madelene Cassée 1697–1771
2 CONT Susanne Cassée 1699–1749
2 CONT Angelique Cassé 1701–1768
2 CONT Élizabeth Cassé 1703–1746
2 CONT Marie Anne Cassé 1703–1773
2 CONT Geneviève Cassé 1706–1770
2 CONT Joseph Lacasse 1708–
2 CONT Charles Casse 1710–1784
2 CONT Marguerite Cassé 1711–1788
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Lacasse 1714–1760
2 CONT Marie Joseph La Casse 1716–1747
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried in Saint-Étienne-de-Beaumont, Québec, Canada, New France.
2 CONT
2 CONT
