2 CONT Notes on Jos. Alfred Mayotte: The family moved from Québec to the Upper Peninsula of Michigan to the areas of Ishpeming and Iron Mountain in the early 1890s. Alfred worked for the railroad and attended the water tower in Iron Moun
2 CONC tain. Alfred and Emilie are buried in the Iron Mountain City Cemetery  His family leads to Louis VII of France and Eleanor of Aquitaine.
