2 CONT Children of Emilie Mayotte and Harvey Vanitvelt:
2 CONT
2 CONT Winifred Born 8 July 1920, died 1976 at age 56
2 CONT
2 CONT Milton Born 22 March 1923; ordained priest 1949
2 CONT
2 CONT Marguerite Born 4 June 1929, died 1975 at age 46
2 CONT
2 CONT Florence Married to Ben Ullwelling
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Florence Mayotte and Ben Ullwelling:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeanne Died about age 20
2 CONT
2 CONT Flora Mae Married to Kenneth Jerome.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Married Claude Altenburn. They had no Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Born 30 December 1887, died March 1979, married to Joseph Barkham. They were divorced. Marie lived in Green Bay, Wisconsin, until her death.
2 CONT
2 CONT George 2nd marriage to Ida ________
2 CONT
2 CONT Eva Born 30 June 1896, died at age 95 in October 1991; married Hans Lawson. They lived in Green Bay, Wisconsin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Eva Mayotte and Hans Lawson:
2 CONT
2 CONT Beverly, married to Raymond Kocha.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1961 the children of Beverly were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ray, Jr., age 17; Pat, age 15; Kris, age 13; Tom, age 11, Jill, age 8, Amy, age 6; Cheryl, age 4; Matt, age 3; Karen, age 1.
2 CONT
2 CONT Yvonne, married to Bob Fonder.
2 CONT
2 CONT Patricia, never married, died age 20 on 21 February 1941
2 CONT
2 CONT Maudine Mae (Maude): Born 17 August 1894 at Ishpeming, Michigan; died on or about 11 April 1970 at Wauwatosa, Wisconsin; married 27 September 1922 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin(?) to Arthur Francis Jacques, Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 25
2 CONT
2 CONT Maudine Mae (Maude): Born 17 August 1894 at Ishpeming, Michigan; died on or about 11 April 1970 at Wauwatosa, Wisconsin; married 27 September 1922 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin(?) to Arthur Francis Jacques, Jr., who was born 21 August 1
2 CONC 899 at Dollar Bay, Michigan and died 26 September 1967 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin. The parents of Arthur Francis Jacques were Arthur Francis Jacques and Celine Marie Des Rosiers of Marquette, Michigan. (See obituaries for Maude and A
2 CONC rthur and Arthur’s parents in the Jacques section of this album.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes on Maude Mayotte Jacques: She celebrated her birthday on 2 September . She was probably baptized on this date.  Her family leads to Louis VII of France and Eleanor of Aquitaine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Arthur Francis Jacques, Jr. and Maude Mayotte:
2 CONT
2 CONT Joan Lorraine:  Born 17 April 1923 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin.  Presently living in Fairfax, Virginia.  Married 10 October 1942 at Quantico, Virginia, to Robert Arthur Scherr, born 27 October 1920, died 1 April 1984 at Fairfax, Virgi
2 CONC nia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Arthur: Born 13 June 1926 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin, died 31 June 1990 at South Bend, Indiana; married 30 September 1950 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin to Ellen A. Handeland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Raoul Thomas: Born 7 August 1934 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin, married to Alice Gannon 1957 (Divorced 1973); remarried Diana Hunt, 1975 (Separated 1983; Divorced 1984).  No children were born of this marriage.  Presently living in Phoe
2 CONC nix, Arizona, where he has a law practice.
2 CONT
2 CONT Remarried in 1987 to Tutsie Silapalikitporn, Phuket Island, Thailand. There are no children born of this marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 26
2 CONT
2 CONT Joan Lorraine:  Born 17 April 1923 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin.  Presently living in Fairfax, Virginia.  Married 10 October 1942 at Quantico, Virginia, to Robert Arthur Scherr, born 27 October 1920, died 1 April 1984 at Fairfax, Virgi
2 CONC nia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes on Joan Lorraine Jacques: Her family leads to Louis VII of France and Eleanor of Aquitaine
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes on Robert Arthur Scherr: He was an attorney in the U.S. Marine Corps and retired a Colonel in the US Marine Corps.  He was also an attorney with the U.S. Postal Service after retiring from the Marines.  He was buried 5 April
2 CONC  1984 in Arlington National Cemetery. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Joan Lorraine Jacques & Robert Arthur Scherr:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacqueline Joanne:   Born 5 September 1945 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin, married 28 February 1964 at Winston-Salem, North Carolina to  Robert Henry Shroy (Divorced 1976).
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael Robert: Born 31 May 1949 at Bethesda, Maryland, married 26 June 1971, in the Chapel at the U.S. Naval Academy at Annapolis, Maryland, to Marliese Martin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen Raoul: Born 22 January 1954 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin, married 10 October 1992 at Woodbridge, Virginia, to Linda Diane Lippold, born 30 April 1958 at Bethesda, Maryland. There are no children of this marriage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 27
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacqueline Joanne:   Born 5 September 1945 at Milwaukee, Wisconsin, married 28 February 1964 at Winston-Salem, North Carolina to  Robert Henry Shroy (Divorced 1976).
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Jacqueline Joanne Scherr & Robert Henry Shroy:
2 CONT
2 CONT Joan Michele (Shelly):   Born 8 September 1972 at Bridgeport, Connecticut, (father Robert H. Shroy -- name legally changed to Scherr in 1976.) ;  married 21 April 2001 at Staints Constantine & Helen Greek Orthodox Church, Washingt
2 CONC on, D.C., to Nicholas James Lambis. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Michael Robert: Born 31 May 1949 at Bethesda, Maryland, married 26 June 1971, in the Chapel at the U.S. Naval Academy at Annapolis, Maryland, to Marliese Martin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Michael Robert Scherr and Marliese Martin:
2 CONT
2 CONT Kristin Marliese: Born 27 December 1973 at Charleston, South Carolina. Graduated from the United States Naval Academy in 1995.  Served on the USS The Sullivans.  Left Navy, now in college studying for Masters Degree in Engineering
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT Renée Marie: Born 27 February 1978 at  Brunswick, Maine. Graduated from Villanova University in May 2000.  Ensign in the U.S. Navy.  Attending flight school.  Learning to fly helicopters.
2 CONT
2 CONT David Michael:  Born 20 January 1983 at Fairfax County, Virginia.  Graduated from high school May 2001.  Now attending U.S. Naval Academy.
2 CONT
