1 OCCU Maria Karolina Sobieska (*25.11.1697, +8.5.1740), Duchess consort of Bouillon, Full Name: Maria Karolina Sobieska, Polish noblewoman
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maria_Karolina_Sobieska Wikipedia...]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Maria Karolina Sobieska (25 November 1697 – 8 May 1740 ) was a Polish noblewoman, daughter of Jakub Ludwik Sobieski. Known as Marie Charlotte or only Charlotte, she was the Princess of Turenne and later Duchess of Bouillon by marr
2 CONC iage. Charlotte was the last surviving member of the House of Sobieski. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Marie Charlotte Sobieska (1697-1740) married Charles Godefroid de la Tour d'Auvergne, Duc de Bouillon (1706-1771). Charles was the son of Emmanuel Theodose de la Tour, Duc de Bouillon (1668-1730) and Marie Armandu Victoire de la T
2 CONC remoille (1677-1717)
2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
