1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 17. POLONIA3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ (BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born 1650 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died October 29, 1675 in Saltillo, Coahuila,
2 CONC  Mexico. She married CAPTAIN JUAN GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-OLEA January 28, 1668 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico, son of JUAN GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-DE-LOS-SANTOS and MARIA DE OLEA-CAMACHO. He was born Abt. 1640 in S
2 CONC altillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for POLONIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ:
2 CONT
2 CONT On October 24, 1675, she signed her last will and testament.
2 CONT
2 CONT Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 103 & 130.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of POLONIA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ and JUAN GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-OLEA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. ALFONSA4 GONZALEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, m. JUAN RAMOS.
2 CONT
2 CONT 115. ii. APOLONIA GONZALEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1671, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; d. Abt. 1709, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico.
2 CONT
