1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 35. JUAN4 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR (JUAN3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born Abt. 1643 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died
2 CONC  July 01, 1714 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married ''' MARIA DE SOSA July 02, 1679 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of DIEGO DE AYALA-TREVINO and MARGARITA SALDIVAR-DE-SOSA. She was born 
2 CONC Abt. 1653 in Mexico City, D.F., Mexico.''' Marriage Notes for JUAN DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA DE SOSA:
