1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria de AYALA [421],[422] was born (date unknown). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: General Diego de AYALA and Ana de VALLE (OVALLE).
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Capt. Nicolas LOPEZ PRIETO. Maria de AYALA and Capt. Nicolas LOPEZ PRIETO were married. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Margarita LOPEZ PRIETO, 
2 CONT *2. Maria LOPEZ PRIETO, 
2 CONT *3. Antonio LOPEZ PRIETO.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b17.html#P8016
2 CONT
2 CONT ================
2 CONT
2 CONT 23. MARIA10 AYALA-OVALLE (DIEGO9 DE AYALA-TREVINO, JOSEPH-DIEGO8 DE TREMINO-Y-QUINTANILLA, JOSE-DIEGO7 DE TREMINO, DIEGO6 TREMINO-DE-VELASCO, BERNARDINO5 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, FRANCISCO4, PEDRO3, JUAN2, PEDRO1) 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1645 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died 20 Feb 1702 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN NICOLAS LOPEZ-PRIETO. He was born 1635 in San Francisco, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARIA AYALA-OVALLE and NICOLAS LOPEZ-PRIETO are:
2 CONT *i. MARGARITA11 LOPEZ-PRIETO, 
2 CONT **b. 1664; 
2 CONT **m. CAPTAIN BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR [2], 13 Jan 1681/82, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico3; 
2 CONT ***b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***d. May 1719, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for MARGARITA LOPEZ-PRIETO and BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR:
2 CONT *****Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 48.
2 CONT *ii. ANTONIO LOPEZ-DE-PRIETO, 
2 CONT **b. 1667, Monclova, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT **m. (1) ANNA-MARIA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, 12 Jun 1689, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1671; 
2 CONT **m. (2) LUISA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-DE-HOYOS, 24 Sep 1704, Monclova, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; 
2 CONT ***b. 1686.
2 CONT ****Marriage Notes for ANTONIO LOPEZ-DE-PRIETO and LUISA FLORES-DE-VALDEZ-DE-HOYOS:
2 CONT *****Marriage source:From the book, Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 279.
