1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 65. FRANCISCO-ALEJO9 TREVINO-ARRIOLA (FRANCISCO-ALEJO8 DE TREVINO-AYALA, LEONOR7 DE AYALA-VALVERDE, MARIANA6 DE GUEVARA-ESTRADA, JUAN-ALONSO5 DE ESTRADA, ANA4 ESTRADA-DE-LA-CABALLERIA, ALONSO3 DE ESTRADA, FERDINAND
2 CONC  II (THE2 CATHOLIC), JOHN II OF1 ARAGON) 
2 CONT *was born 1658 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and 
2 CONT *died 01 Jan 1700/01 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA-JUANA CHAPA-TREVINO, daughter of JUAN CHAPA and BEATRIZ OLIVARES-DE-TREVINO. She was born 1660.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCO-ALEJO TREVINO-ARRIOLA and MARIA-JUANA CHAPA-TREVINO are:
2 CONT *i. FRANCISCO10 TREVINO-CHAPA, b. 24 Nov 1681, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. CLARA-JOSEFA SAENZ, 25 Apr 1701, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT **Notes for CLARA-JOSEFA SAENZ: A.K.A. Clara Josefa de Cepeda.
2 CONT **Marriage Notes for FRANCISCO TREVINO-CHAPA and CLARA-JOSEFA SAENZ: Marriage source from the book, Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J, Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr.
2 CONC  Page 272.
2 CONT *ii. JOSEFA TREVINO-CHAPA, b. 12 May 1684, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. BERNABE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, Feb 1701/02, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 29 Aug 1667.
2 CONT *iii. MARIA-ROSA TREVINO-CHAPA, b. 21 Aug 1687, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. FRANCISCO NUNEZ-DE-CARVAJAL-RODRIGUEZ, 13 Nov 1701, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 11 Mar 1679/80
2 CONC .
2 CONT **Marriage Notes for MARIA-ROSA TREVINO-CHAPA and FRANCISCO NUNEZ-DE-CARVAJAL-RODRIGUEZ: Marriage source:Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela,
2 CONC  Jr. Page 274.
2 CONT *iv. PEDRO-REGALDO TREVINO-CHAPA, b. 26 Feb 1690/91, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico
