1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Villanueva de Cavazos, Lilia E. '' Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey'', Monterrey, Nuevo León, Mexico, 1991, pages 18-22. [Ramo Civil, Vol. 5, Exp. 22, Folio 3]   ...  The '''1643 will of Capitán Miguel De Montem
2 CONC ayor'''  (dated 11 October 1643) cites his parents, his wife Mónica Rodríguez, her parents Capitán Diego Rodríguez and Sebastiana de Tremiño, a deceased son Lucas, as well as his legitimate children Diego, Margarita, '''Petrona'''
2 CONC , María, Francisco, Domingo, José, Bernardo, and Mateo.  Additionally, the will cites two "bastard" daughters: María, wife of Juan Maldonado, and Juana, wife of Andrés de Charles.  Further, the will directs that he be interred in 
2 CONC Monterrey's Iglesia Parroquial and states that he is ill near to death. 
2 CONT
2 CONT II.	Miguel MONTEMAYOR DEL-CANTO b. abt 1588, Mexico City D.F. (Ciudad de Mexico), Mex, m. Monica RODRIGUEZ TREVIÑO, b. Mexico City D.F. (Ciudad de Mexico), Mex, (daughter of Diego RODRIGUEZ SOSA and Sebastiana TREVIÑO FARIAS). Mig
2 CONC uel died Jun 1644.
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter:	
2 CONT
2 CONT Petronila MONTEMAYOR RODRIGUEZ m. Lazaro DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON GONZALEZ, b. abt 1625, State of N.L., Mex, (son of Blas DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON TREVIÑO and Beatriz GONZALEZ-HIDALGO NAVARRO) d. 22 Feb 1694. 1.	Miguel MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA-
2 CONC FALCON m. 1685, Clara RENTERIA VILLARREAL, (daughter of Diego VILLARREAL DE-LAS-CASAS and Ines DE-RENTERIA). 
2 CONT
2 CONT had: a.	Diego MONTEMAYOR RENTERIA m. Luisa DE-LA-GARZA OCHOA, (daughter of Federico DE-LA-GARZA and Gertrudis OCHOA).
2 CONT
2 CONT  2.	Francisco MONTEMAYOR-DE-LA-GARZA FALCON m. Francisca MARTINEZ DE-LA-GARZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT  3.	Pedro MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON m. Antonia CANTU VILLARREAL.
2 CONT
2 CONT  4.	Santiago MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.	Jose MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON m. Josefa DE-SOSA DE-LA-GARZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.	Isidro MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON m. ?????? CANTU.
2 CONT
2 CONT    had: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a.	Jose DE-LA-GARZA CANTU m. 24 Jul 1730, in Salinas Victoria, N.L., Mex, Rosa VILLARREAL FLORES, b. 1707, Monterrey, N.L., Mex, (daughter of Marcos VILLARREAL DE-LA-GARZA and Maria FLORES AYALA).
2 CONT
2 CONT  7.	Angela MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON m. Jose GONZALEZ.
2 CONT
2 CONT  8.	Gertrudis DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON MONTEMAYOR m. (1) Cristobal VILLARREAL, m. (2) Manuel DE-LA-GARZA RENTERIA, m. (3) abt 1688, Fernando CANTU TREVIÑO, (son of Geronimo CANTU DEL-RIO-Y-LA-CERDA and Juliana TREVIÑO GONZALEZ).
2 CONT
2 CONT  a.	Maria CANTU DE-LA-GARZA m. Cristobal VILLARREAL IZAGUIRRE, (son of Francisco VILLARREAL DE-LAS-CASAS and Ursula IZAGUIRRE DE-URRUTIA).
2 CONT
2 CONT 9.	Monica MONTEMAYOR DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON m. Pedro HEREDIA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 0.	Maria DE-LA-GARZA MONTEMAYOR m. (1) 1 Oct 1673, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Diego AYALA TREVIÑO, b. 1618 or 1619, (son of Jose TREVIÑO QUINTANILLA and Leonor DE-AYALA VALVERDE) d. 25 Dec 1682, Monterrey, N.L., Mex, m. (2) 10 Apr 1
2 CONC 684, in Monterrey, N.L., Mex, Tomas GARCIA DE-QUINTANILLA, (son of Lucas GARCIA RODRIGUEZ and Juliana QUINTANILLA FARIAS) m. (3) Andres GONZALEZ GOMEZ, (son of Bartolome GONZALEZ and Isabel GOMEZ). Maria died 16 Apr 1698.
2 CONT
2 CONT had: a.	Petronila GARCIA DE-LA-GARZA m. 13 Dec 1698, Jose GONZALEZ NAVARRO, (son of Antonio GONZALEZ-HIDALGO and Juana AMAYA TREVIÑO).
2 CONT
2 CONT b.	Cristobal GARCIA DE-LA-GARZA m. Maria Josefa BUENTELLO.
2 CONT
2 CONT c.	Juan Francisco GARCIA DE-LA-GARZA
2 CONT
