2 CONT  ====================================================  14.  Lazaro Gonzales De La Garza FALCON1 (Blas Maria Trevino De La Garza, Marcos  Alonzo Garza Y del Arcon). Lazaro married Petronila Rodriguez de MONTEMAYOR. Petronila was bo
2 CONC rn 1625. They had the following children: 35 F i. Maria Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. Maria married (1) Diego de AYALA. Maria also married (2) Tomas Garcia de QUINTANILLA. 36 F ii. Angela Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 37 M iii. 
2 CONC Francisco Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 38 M iv. Gertrudis Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 39 F v. Isabel Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 40 M vi. Isidro Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 41 M vii. Jose Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 
2 CONC 42 M viii. Miguel Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 43 F ix. Monica Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 44 M x. Pedro Montemayor de la Garza FALCON. 45 M xi. Santiago Montemayor de la Garza FALCON.
2 CONT
