2 CONT 6. SERGEANT MAJOR JUAN3 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO (BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born Abt. 1620 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died May 03, 1673 in Monterrey, Nuev
2 CONC o Leon, Mexico. He married MARIA-MARGARITA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR Abt. 1640 in Mexico City, F.D. Mexico, daughter of MIGUEL DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR and MONICA RODRIGUEZ-TREVINO. She was born Abt. 1626 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexic
2 CONC o, and died February 27, 1680/81 in Hacienda San Juan Bautista, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JUAN DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO and MARIA-MARGARITA RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MARIA-INES4 DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. DIEGO DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT 34. iii. JUAN-JOSE DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, b. Mier, Tamaulipas, Mexico?
2 CONT
2 CONT 35. iv. JUAN DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, b. Abt. 1643, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. July 01, 1714, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 36. v. ALFEREZ JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1656, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 37. vi. SALVADOR DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, b. Abt. 1659, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 38. vii. MARGARITA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1661, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. GRABRIEL DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1663, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 39. ix. CLARA DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, b. September 26, 1668, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT 40. x. CAPTAIN BLAS DE-LA-GARZA-MONTEMAYOR, b. 1670, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. May 1719, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico
2 CONT
