1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LJJW-3Y4
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Françoise'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Françoise Cassé was born on 19 June 1692, in Beaumont, Québec, Canada, New France, her father, Joseph Cassé, was 22 and her mother, Marie Bazin, was 19. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 1st husband Etienne Roy (1690–1749) circa 1710.
2 CONT They had 10 children:
2 CONT Joseph Le Roy 1711–1760
2 CONT Marie Josephe Le Roy 1714–1769
2 CONT Etienne Roy II 1716–1772
2 CONT Marguerite Le Roy 1718–1748
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Le Roy 1720–1749
2 CONT Elizabeth Le Roy 1723–1753
2 CONT Pierre Le Roy 1725–1764
2 CONT Françoise Basilisse Le Roy 1728–
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Le Roy 1730–
2 CONT Marie Genevieve Le Roy 1733–1804
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 2nd husband Jean Baptiste Brochu III on 9 January 1741, in Saint-Vallier, Bellechasse, Quebec, Canada. They were the parents of at least 1 daughter. 
2 CONT Marie Françoise BROCHU 1744 – 1811
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 5 January 1764, in Saint-Vallier, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 71, and was buried in Saint-Vallier, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America.
2 CONT -------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT
