2 CONT Brief Life History of Louise'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Louise Cassée was born on 19 April 1696, in Beaumont, Québec, Canada, New France, her father, Joseph Cassé, was 26 and her mother, Marie Bazin, was 23. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jacques Elie on 3 September 1715, in Saint-Étienne-de-Beaumont, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 5 April 1766, in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America, at the age of 69, and was buried in Saint-Jean-Baptiste, District Judiciaire de Québec, Quebec, British North America.
