1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LJ1L-XKR
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Madeleine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Madeleine Cassée was born about August 1697, in Saint-Étienne-de-Beaumont, Québec, Canada, New France, her father, Joseph Cassé, was 28 and her mother, Marie Bazin, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Jean Baptiste Couture on 17 November 1722, in Saint-Étienne-de-Beaumont, Québec, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 4 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Couture 1723–1769
2 CONT Joseph Couture 1725–
2 CONT Elisabeth Couture 1726–1797
2 CONT Jean Francois Couture 1727–1733
2 CONT Louis Couture 1729–1798
2 CONT Joseph Marie Couture 1731–1803
2 CONT Catherine Couture 1733–1757
2 CONT Augustin Couture 1735–1735
2 CONT Jean Baptiste Couture 1735–1799
2 CONT Cecile Couture 1739–1814
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 4 June 1771, in Saint-Charles-de-Bellechasse, Québec, Canada, New France, at the age of 73, and was buried in Saint-Charles-de-Bellechasse, Québec, Canada, New France.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
