2 CONT
2 CONT 5. ANTOINE4 NADEAU (JEAN-BAPTISTE3, OZANIE-JOSEPH NADEAU DIT2 LAVIGNE, MAÇIA1 NADEAU) was born February 12, 1699/00 in St. Laurent, Île d'Orleans, Québec. He married (1) MARGUERITE TURGEON May 06, 1726 in Beaumont, Québec, daughte
2 CONC r of ZACHARIE TURGEON and ÉLISABETH ROY. She was born December 27, 1710 in Beaumont, Québec, and died November 08, 1763. He married (2) CHARLOTTE HUBERT Aft. 1763, daughter of SIMON HUBERT. She was born 1702, and died December 19,
2 CONC  1770.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ANTOINE NADEAU and MARGUERITE TURGEON are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 14. 	i. 	  	FRANCOIS-ETIENNE5 NADEAU, b. February 11, 1726/27, Beaumont, Bellechase, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15. 	ii. 	  	ANTOINE NADEAU, b. March 10, 1727/28, Beaumont, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	iii. 	  	MARGUERITE NADEAU, b. April 26, 1729, Beaumont, Quebec; d. July 29, 1729.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	iv. 	  	MARIE NADEAU, b. July 27, 1730, Beaumont, Quebec; m. LOUIS FRECHET, November 08, 1751.
2 CONT
2 CONT 16. 	v. 	  	LOUIS NADEAU, b. January 07, 1731/32.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	vi. 	  	MARIE-ANNE NADEAU, b. November 18, 1733; d. January 02, 1733/34.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	vii. 	  	MARIE-GENEVIÈVE NADEAU, b. December 09, 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	viii. 	  	JOSEPH NADEAU, b. October 14, 1736; m. ANGÉLIQUE DELESSARD, 1776.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	ix. 	  	LOUIS-ALEXANDRE NADEAU, b. April 20, 1738.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	x. 	  	BABY NADEAU, b. May 17, 1739; d. May 17, 1739.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	xi. 	  	JEAN-BAPTISTE NADEAU, b. February 02, 1740/41.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	xii. 	  	GENEVIÈVE NADEAU, b. July 03, 1742; d. November 19, 1763, St. Antoine-Tilly; m. LOUIS-ALEXANDRE MARION, September 19, 1757.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	xiii. 	  	MARGUERITE NADEAU, b. July 04, 1748; d. May 11, 1817; m. JEAN-BAPTISTE COUTURE, October 17, 1764.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	xiv. 	  	MARIE-THÉRÈSE NADEAU, b. October 19, 1749; m. GUILLAUME GOSSELIN.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	xv. 	  	THEOTISTE NADEAU, b. June 21, 1753; d. October 30, 1754.
