1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=102205047
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean lived to age 72
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:  Aug. 24, 1696 Saint-Etienne Quebec, Canada  Death:  Jun. 14, 1769 Saint-Etienne Quebec, Canada 
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptismal Record revealed Jean Baptiste Nadeau was baptized in August 1696 in Beaumont, Quebec. Place of worship was St Etienne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage record revealed Jean Baptiste Nadeau and Louise Turgeon married on January 13, 1727 in Beaumont, Quebec. Place of worship was St Etienne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean was thirty and Louise was twenty when they married.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Louise Nadeau (b.1727) Charlotte Nadeau (b.1729) Madeleine Nadeau (b.1732) Joseph Charles Nadeau (b.1735) Zacharie Nadeau (b.1737 d.1810) Jean Baptiste Nadeau (b.1740 d.1795) Anne Nadeau (b.1743 d.1759)
2 CONT
2 CONT They had been married forty-two when Jean died in 1769.
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial Record revealed Jean Baptiste Nadeau was buried in June 1769 in St Etienne de Beaumont, Quebec. 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
