2 CONT
2 CONT 10. GUILLAUME4 NADEAU (DENIS3, OZANIE-JOSEPH NADEAU DIT2 LAVIGNE, MAÇIA1 NADEAU) was born December 01, 1708 in St. Étienne, Beaumont, Québec, and died November 23, 1798 in St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec. He married (1) THÉRÈSE R
2 CONC OY February 27, 1736/37 in Beaumont, Québec, daughter of GUILLAUME ROY and ANGÉLIQUE BAZIN. She was born November 02, 1717, and died April 03, 1746. He married (2) MARIE-URSULE JAHAN-LAVIOLETTE August 21, 1747 in Saint-Joseph, Poi
2 CONC nte-de-Lévy, Lauzon, Québec, daughter of JACQUES LAVIOLETTE and MARIE-ANNE SOREAUX-DESLAURIERS. She was born September 28, 1722 in Saint-Joseph, Pointe-de-Lévy, Lauzon, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of GUILLAUME NADEAU and THÉRÈSE ROY are:
2 CONT
2 CONT   	i. 	  	MARIE-CATHERINE5 NADEAU, b. March 29, 1738, Beaumont, Quebec; m. ANTOINE GIRARD, October 11, 1763, Levis, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	ii. 	  	MARIE-THÉRÈSE NADEAU, b. February 18, 1738/39, Beaumont, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	iii. 	  	JOSEPH-MARIE NADEAU, b. March 18, 1739/40, Beaumont, Quebec; m. (1) REINE JANOT, February 09, 1773; m. (2) CHARLOTTE GILBERT, July 28, 1812.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	iv. 	  	JEAN-BAPTISTE NADEAU, b. February 23, 1741/42; m. MARIE-GENEVIÈVE AUBOIS, November 17, 1766, St. Michel, Quebec; b. February 14, 1748/49, La Durantaye, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	v. 	  	MARIE-LOUISE NADEAU, b. August 02, 1744, Beaumont, Quebec; m. FRANCOIS COTE, November 07, 1768, St. Charles, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	vi. 	  	ALEXANDRE NADEAU, b. March 18, 1745/46, Beaumont, Quebec.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of GUILLAUME NADEAU and MARIE-URSULE JAHAN-LAVIOLETTE are:
2 CONT
2 CONT   	vii. 	  	MARIE5 NADEAU, b. July 05, 1748, Beaumont, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT 27. 	viii. 	  	MARIE-JOSEPHE NADEAU, b. September 27, 1749, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	ix. 	  	LOUIS NADEAU, b. February 14, 1750/51, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec; m. CATHERINE GAUTHIER, October 03, 1774, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec; b. April 13, 1748, Beaumont, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	x. 	  	CHARLES NADEAU, b. August 10, 1752, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec; d. January 23, 1758, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	xi. 	  	MARIE-ANNE NADEAU, b. July 20, 1754, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	xii. 	  	PETRONILLE NADEAU, b. February 17, 1757, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec; m. MICHEL PAQUET-VALLEE, November 23, 1779, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT 28. 	xiii. 	  	GUILLAUME NADEAU, b. February 08, 1759, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT 29. 	xiv. 	  	CHARLES NADEAU, b. February 18, 1762, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec; d. December 24, 1817, Bellechasse, Québec.
2 CONT
2 CONT   	xv. 	  	ANGÉLIQUE NADEAU, b. July 14, 1764, St. Charles, Bellechasse, Québec.
