1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/L6S6-6JR
2 CONT Brief Life History of Antoine'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Antoine Casse dit Lacasse was born on 15 May 1707, in Saint-Étienne-de-Beaumont, Bellechasse, Quebec, Canada, his father, Charles Cassé, was 25 and his mother, Françoise Paquier/Paquet, was 24. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Marie Angelique Archambault (1711-1737) on 3 February 1733, in Longue-Pointe, Montreal, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 2 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 2nd wife Marie Marguerite Sionnaux Desmoulins (1706–1778)
2 CONT on 4 Août [August] 1738 in Saint-Enfant-Jésus-De-La-Pointe-Aux-Trembles, Ile De Montreal,Quebec
2 CONT They had at least 8 children
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 13 September 1768, in Saint-Sulpice, L'Assomption, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 61, and was buried in Saint-Sulpice, L'Assomption, Quebec, Canada.
2 CONT
2 CONT
