1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/KG1T-DL2
2 CONT Brief Life History of Marie Élisabeth'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When Marie Élisabeth Pépin was born on 15 August 1712, in Champlain, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France, her father, Jean Pépin, was 36 and her mother, Jacqueline du Billy, was 27. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Noel Augustin Du Bucq on 23 January 1736, in Champlain, Trois-Rivières, Canada, New France. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT Marie Elizabeth Dubuc 1736–1805
2 CONT Joseph Dubuc 1738–
2 CONT Marie Josephe Dubuc 1740–1813
2 CONT Marie Madeleine Dubuc 1742–1742
2 CONT Noel Augustin Dubuc 1743–1743
2 CONT Pierre Dubuc 1744–
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 21 February 1744, in Saint-Pierre-les-Becquets, Bécancour, Quebec, Canada, at the age of 31, and was buried in Saint-Pierre-les-Becquets, Bécancour, Quebec, Canada.
