1 NOTE {geni:about_me} After her husband`s death she took over as Commandant of the post.It was a unique position for a woman to hold in American history: military commander, civil governor, judge and jury, over a domain of half a millio
2 CONC n square miles. She held this position for 6 years until she returned to Montreal.
