1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT * [http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clemens_Franz_de_Paula_von_Bayern wikipedia - German...] Clement Francis de Paula, Prince of Bavaria (born 19 April 1722 in Munich, † August 6, 1770 ibid) was the son of the imperial Field Marshal F
2 CONC erdinand Maria of Bavaria Innocent and thus a grandson of the Bavarian Elector Maximilian II Emanuel.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 17 He married in January 1742 in Mannheim, Maria Anna of Pfalz-Sulzbach, a daughter of Joseph Karl von Pfalz-Sulzbach and grand-daughter of the Elector Palatine Charles III. Philip. Between 1748 and 1756 the couple have a son a
2 CONC nd three daughters were born, all of whom died in childhood. Survivors sons from his marriage in 1777 after the death of Maximilian would III. Joseph inherited the Bavarian Electorate. Thus, Clement Francis was 25 years (1745-1770
2 CONC ), Elector of Bavaria, in fact. 
2 CONT ======Golden Fleece - Knights: Spanish Branch======
2 CONT ===References===
2 CONT
