2 CONT In 1732 Aaron (Daniel ) Mendoza published one of the first books produced by a Jew in England, a manuel of the laws governing ritual slaughter, with illustrations in his own hand: "Dinim de Sehita, y Bedica" (Laws of Slaughter and
