1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Capt. Francisco RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor495,637,673,674,1436 was born (date unknown). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage investigation #46-3, page 203, indicates that Francisco was also married to a woman named Maria Barrera. Maria Barrera would probably have been Francisco Rodriguez's first wife. Or, Maria Barrera could be an alias for Mar
2 CONC ia Caballero. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents: Capt. Diego RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor and Ines DE LA GARZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria BARRERA. Maria BARRERA and Capt. Francisco RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor were married. Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Catarina RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Maria CABALLERO de Olivos. Maria CABALLERO de Olivos and Capt. Francisco RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor were married on 28 November 1684.675 Children were: 
2 CONT *1. Joseph RODRIGUEZ, 
2 CONT *2. Clara Maria RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor, 
2 CONT *3. Francisco RODRIGUEZ, 
2 CONT *4. Gertrudis RODRIGUEZ de Montemayor.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.raullongoria.net/Genealogy/FamilyTree/b189.html#P8458
2 CONT
2 CONT =============================
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. FRANCISCO5 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR (DIEGO4, MIGUEL3 DEL CANTO-MONTEMAYOR, ALBERTO2 DEL CANTO, SEBASTIANO MARTINS1) 
2 CONT *was born 1650. 
2 CONT *He married MARIA-JUANA CABALLERO-BARRAZA 24 Jun 1694 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of LUCAS CABALLERO-DE-LOS-OLIVOS and JUANA DE BARRAZA. She was born 1652.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of FRANCISCO RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR and MARIA-JUANA CABALLERO-BARRAZA are:
2 CONT *i. CLARA MARIA6 RODRIGUEZ-DE-MONTEMAYOR, m. NICOLAS RODRIGUEZ-SALDIVAR, 18 Jul 1730, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1700, Villa de Pilon, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
