2 CONC s:	Clara De La Garza Trevino Garcia (born De La Garza Montemayor), Jose (Joseph) De La Garza Montemayor, Juan De La Garza Montemayor, Salvador, Capitan De La Garza Montemayor, Margarita De La Garza Falcon Montemayor Wife:	Margarit
