1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 3. PEDRO3 FLORES-DE-ABREGO (PEDRO2, PEDRO1) was born in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, and died March 16, 1682 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married JOSEFA DE CEPEDA-CABALLERO in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico, dau
2 CONC ghter of ESTEBAN DE CEPEDA-DE-LA-FUENTE and ISABEL CAMACHO-Y-OLEA-BAEZA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO:
2 CONT
2 CONT On April 1, 1682, he signed his last will and testament.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Testamentos Coloniales de Monterrey, by Lilia E. Villanueva de Cavazos.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of PEDRO FLORES-DE-ABREGO and JOSEFA DE CEPEDA-CABALLERO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. FRANCISCO JAVIER4 FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. BALTAZAR FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. iii. LAZARO FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12. iv. MARIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO, b. 1676, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. ANTONIA FLORES-DE-ABREGO-Y-CEPEDA, b. 1687; m. LUIS FARIAS-AGUIRRE, April 20, 1705, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; b. 1685.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for LUIS FARIAS-AGUIRRE: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 282
2 CONT
