2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Gregoria DE LA GARZA. Gregoria DE LA GARZA and Juan Bautista de VILLARREAL were married on 8 August 1695.1234 The marriage investigation by the Church was done on February 15, 1695.
2 CONT
