1 NOTE {geni:about_me} See Note below:  There are two brothers Juan Bautista & Juan de Villarreal Casas who married two sister: Clara Luisa and Juana de la Garza.  See Beatriz de las Casas' Acta de defuncion:  it lists all of her sons, i
2 CONC ncluding Juan Bautista and Juan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. CAPTAIN JUAN3 DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS (DIEGO2 DE VILLARREAL, FRANCISCO1 VILLARREAL) was born 1638 in Valle de Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married (1) JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-Y-GARCIA, daughter of FRANCISCO DE-LA-GARZA-F
2 CONC ALCON-TREVINO and JUANA GUTIERREZ-DE-LARA-GARCIA. She was born 1642 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Notes for CAPTAIN JUAN DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS: Founder of the silver mine at Boca de Leones, Villaldama, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONC  Children of JUAN DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS and JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-Y-GARCIA are: 2. i. PETRONILA4 DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. ii. LUCAS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. February 28, 1668/69
2 CONC , Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 3. iii. CAPTAIN FRANCISCO DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. March 09, 1668/69; d. Abt. 1723, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 4. iv. MARCOS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1670, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. v. JU
2 CONC AN VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1672, Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MARIA DE-LA-GARZA-RENTERIA-SEPULVEDA, August 16, 1692, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1674, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. July 08
2 CONC , 1715, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 5. vi. ANA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1674, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. vii. DIEGO VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. October 06, 1674, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (1) BERNA
2 CONC RDA TREVINO-RENTERIA, 1700; b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (2) MARGARITA DE-LA-MOTA, January 19, 1700/01, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1682, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Notes for BERNARDA TREVINO-RENTERIA: A.K.A. Ber
2 CONC narda de Sepulveda. 6. viii. FRANCISCA DE-LA-GARZA-VILLARREAL, b. Abt. 1675. ix. MATHEO VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1678, Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. APOLONIA GONZALEZ-DE-LA-GARZA, September 18, 1698, Saltillo, Coa
2 CONC huila, Mexico; b. 1671, Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico; d. Abt. 1709, Saltillo, Coahulia, Mexico. Notes for APOLONIA GONZALEZ-DE-LA-GARZA: She signed her last will and testament in 1709. 7. x. MARIA DE VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA, b. 1666,
2 CONC  Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. WFT Est. 1693-1761, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Child of CAPTAIN JUAN DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS is: 8. xi. GABRIEL4 DE VILLARREAL, b. 1662, Valle de las Salinas, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.  
2 CONT
2 CONT MARCOS4 VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA (JUAN3 DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS, DIEGO2 DE VILLARREAL, FRANCISCO1 VILLARREAL) was born 1670 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He married MARIA-RITA FLORES-Y-AYALA April 30, 1700 in Sagrario Metropo
2 CONC litano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, daughter of MARCOS FLORES-DE-ABREGO-DE-LA-GARZA and ANA DE AYALA-OVALLE. She was born 1680 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage Notes for MARCOS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA and MARIA-RITA FLORES-Y-AYALA:
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage source:From the book, Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 43.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of MARCOS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA and MARIA-RITA FLORES-Y-AYALA are:
2 CONT
2 CONT 20. i. MARIA-ROSA5 DE VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT _______
2 CONT
2 CONT There are two first cousins by the name Marcos de Villarreal Flores.  They are the sons of two brothers who married two sisters.  In other trees, many have confused this information.
2 CONT
2 CONT Juan Bautista de Villarreal de las Casas married Clara Luisa de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT Juan de Villarreal de las Casa (above' younger brother) married Juana de la Garza.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara'''
2 CONT   by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. confirms this.
2 CONT
2 CONT Attached to profile of Beatriz de la Casas Navarro is the parish record of her death..  The bottom of the document names the sons who notified the priest of their mother's death: Diego, Juan and Juan Bautista.
2 CONT
2 CONT 326. MARIA-RITA5 FLORES-Y-AYALA (MARCOS4 FLORES-DE-ABREGO-DE-LA-GARZA, MARGARITA3 DE-LA-GARZA-GONZALEZ-HIDALGO, BLAS MARIA2 DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-TREVINO, MARCOS-ALONSO1 DE-LA-GARZA-Y-ARCON) was born 1680 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Me
2 CONC xico. She married MARCOS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA April 30, 1700 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of JUAN DE VILLARREAL-DE-LAS-CASAS and JUANA DE-LA-GARZA-FALCON-Y-GARCIA. He was born 1670 in Monterrey, 
2 CONC Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Marriage Notes for MARIA-RITA FLORES-Y-AYALA and MARCOS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. 
2 CONC Page 43.  
2 CONT Children of MARIA-RITA FLORES-Y-AYALA and MARCOS VILLARREAL-DE-LA-GARZA are: i. MARIA-ROSA6 DE VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-CANTU, July 24, 1730, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. Mont
2 CONC errey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Marriage Notes for MARIA-ROSA DE VILLARREAL-FLORES and JOSEPH DE-LA-GARZA-CANTU: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara by Raul J. Guerra, Jr., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Ve
2 CONC la, Jr. Page 90. ii. MARCOS VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. December 29, 1722, Nuestra Senora de Guadalupe Salinas Victoria, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. MARIA-HERMENEGILDA TREVINO-GALVAN, February 10, 1744, Sagrario Metro, Mont
2 CONC errey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. Notes for MARCOS VILLARREAL-FLORES: Mil Familias III by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, Page 94. Notes for MARIA-HERMENEGILDA TREVINO-GALVAN: A.K.A. Hermenegilda Garcia. iii. JOSEPH-BERNARDO VILLARREAL-FLO
2 CONC RES, b. 1700; m. MARIA-GERTRUDIS DE-LA-GARZA, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. iv. MARIA GERTRUDIS DE VILLARREAL, b. 1702, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. CAPTAIN CRISTOBAL CANTU-DEL
2 CONC -RIO-Y-DE-LA-CERDA, November 25, 1720, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1700, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; d. Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. v. MARIA-JOSEFA VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. 1706, Boca de Leones, Nuevo
2 CONC  Leon, Mexico; m. ANTONIO DE VILLARREAL-MARTINEZ, 1724; b. 1704, Boca de Leones, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. vi. NICOLAS DE VILLARREAL-FLORES, b. 1708, Salinas Victoria, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (1) GERTRUDIS GUTIERREZ-DE-LARA-VILLARREAL, A
2 CONC ugust 12, 1724, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; m. (2) JUANA-MARIA GONZALEZ-DE-PAREDES-VILLARREAL, June 15, 1730, Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico; b. 1711. Marriage Notes for NICOLAS DE VILLARREAL-FLORES and GERTRUDIS
