2 CONT 15. CAPTAIN PEDRO5 BOTELLO-DE-MORALES (FRANCISCO4, PEDRO3, UNKNOWN2 BUENTELLO-GUERRERO, BOTELLO1 BUENTELLO) was born 1657 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, and died October 22, 1717 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. He met (1) SEB
