1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 4. FRANCISCO3 SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA (FRANCISCO2, JUAN1 SANCHEZ-Y-ORTEGA) 
2 CONT *was born Abt. 1632 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (1) MARIA BERLANGA Abt. 1657 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (2) INEZ BOTELLO-DE-MORALES-Y-DE-LA-PAZ February 05, 1697 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, 
2 CONT **daughter of PEDRO BOTELLO-DE-MORALES and SEBASTIANA DE-LA-PAZ. She was born 1682 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT *He married (3) ANTONIA PEREZ-DE-LA-GARZA August 26, 1734 in Sagrario Metro, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. 
2 CONT **Notes for INEZ BOTELLO-DE-MORALES-Y-DE-LA-PAZ: A.K.A. Elena Botello.
2 CONT **Marriage Notes for FRANCISCO SANCHEZ-DE-LA-BARRERA and INEZ BOTELLO-DE-MORALES-Y-DE-LA-PAZ: Index to the Marriage Investigations of the Diocese of Guadalajara, by Raul J. Guerra., Nadine M. Vasquez, Baldomero Vela, Jr. Page 171.
