1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sergeant '''Tomas Sanchez Duran''' born 1650 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain, died January 1688 or 1689.  Father of  Tomas Sanchez de la Barrera, founder of San Agustin de Laredo, Texas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:
2 CONT #Ana Maria de la Barrera Navarro, January 21, 1673, in Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain, daughter of Melchor de la Barrera Rodriguez and Mariana Navarro Trevino. She was born 1655.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tomas Sanchez Duran and Ana Maria de la Barrera Navarro had seven children:
2 CONT #Antonia Sanchez de la Barrera, d. Cienega de Flores, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.
2 CONT #Antonio Sanchez de la Barrera.
2 CONT #Juan Sanchez de la Barrera, b. December 26, 1673, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.
2 CONT #Josefa Sanchez de la Barrera, b. January 26, 1677 or 1678, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.
2 CONT #Tomas Sanchez de la Barrera, b. April 23, 1680, Sagrario Metropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain, d. Abt. 1739. Founder of San Agustin de Laredo, Texas.
2 CONT #Michaela Sanchez de la Barrera, b. March 05, 1683, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain, married Alferez Joseph de la Garza, March 06, 1714, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.
2 CONT #Melchor de los Santos Sanchez de la Barrera, b. May 01, 1689, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, New Spain, d. February 25, 1749 or 1750, Guajuco, Nuevo Leon, New Spain.
2 CONT
