1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jose Maria Chapa (0200) 
2 CONT *was born ca. 1663, the legitimate son of Juan Bautista Chapa (0100) and Beatriz Olivares de Trevino. 
2 CONT *Jose Maria Chapa married Nicolasa Fernandez (0201) in 1694. Nicolasa is the daughter of Captain Gregorio Fernandez and Maria Gonzalez. Maria Gonzalez is the daughter of Diego Gonzalez and Maria Ochoa. Marriage Investigations p-13
2 CONC 5.
2 CONT *On September 12, 1697, he married Josefa Sanchez de la Barrera (0200), the daughter of Alferez Thomas Sanches and Maria Barrera, in the Cathedral of Monterrey [M601497-0355]. Maria Barrera is the daughter of Melchor Barrera and M
2 CONC ariana Nabarro. Marriage Investigations p-164.
2 CONT *From his second marriage he had two children:
2 CONT **1. Agustin Xavier Chapa (0300) was baptised on September 10, 1700, at the Cathedral of Monterrey. Agustin Xavier Chapa (0300) married Antonia Guaxardo on February 4, 1727, at the Cathedral of Monterrey.
2 CONT **2. Josefa Chapa (0301) who may be the Josepha Chapa that married Franco. Xavier Saens on August 16, 1728, in Monterrey and Franco. Xavier Perez on April 20, 1735, in Monterrey.
2 CONT *Jose Maria Chapa (0200) married Maria Francisca de Ochoa (0207) in the Cathedral of Monterrey on June 27, 1717. [M601497-0767] There was one child born of this union.
2 CONT **1. Maria Rosa Chapa Ochoa (0303) was baptised on February 6, 1721, at the Cathedral of Monterrey. [C601491-3216]
2 CONT
