0 @N6000000002322320487@ NOTE She was an ambitious young French widow who began working for support of her
1 CONT husband's potential advancement to the throne of Poland, especally in France.
1 CONT Although letters were exchanged between her and her husband during their many
1 CONT separations, only those of her husband have survived and used as important
1 CONT historical sources. Her husband spent large sums on his residences,
1 CONT especially on the palace of Wilanow. Of Polish rulers of the 17th centrury, he
1 CONT was the best educated and the  most interested in literature & cultural life.
