1 CONT nobles and within his own family. His eldest son, James, was bitterly opposed
1 CONT to his mother the Queen and the younger brothers or princes. The marriage of
1 CONT his daughter Kunegunda to Maximilian in 1694 was the only bright spot in
1 CONT those rather gloomy years.
